Third-party components
----------------------

Vendored binaries and node_modules under this tree keep their own licences,
which neither the grant above nor this file alters. Notably
tools/dependency/ carries ffmpeg, uv and a Python distribution.

Project data
------------

tools/work-memory/data/ may still hold memory captured while working on
company projects. That is data, not tooling, and the grant above is about
tooling. Clear it before using this kit for unrelated work.
